<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="09">
<name>SRS Airbag &amp; Seat Belt</name>
<section id="1000Z_S001D" variety="S001D">
<name>Seat Belt</name>
<ttl id="1000Z_S001D_746PL_T00CK" variety="T00CK">
<name>Seat Belt Warning System</name>
<para id="RM000001OPX00AX" category="J" type-id="301CD" name-id="560ZQ-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Driver Side Seat Belt Warning Light Does Not Operate</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000001OPX00AX_13" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AF700000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>When the ignition is turned ON, the instrument panel junction block (main body ECU) transmits the status of the front seat inner belt assembly RH to the combination meter assembly (meter ECU) via CAN communication. When the tongue plate is not inserted into the buckle, the combination meter assembly (meter ECU) blinks the driver seat belt warning light, and turns it off when the tongue plate is inserted.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>The seat belt warning system uses CAN communication. First, perform "CAN Communication System Check" according to "How to Proceed with Troubleshooting", confirm that there is no malfunction in the CAN communication system, and then proceed with troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001OPX00AX_14" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AF800000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B167507J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001OPX00AX_15" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000001OPX00AX_16" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0016" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AF900000">
<testtitle>Perform TaSCAN Active Test</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Driver Seat Belt Warning Light Active Test</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), perform the Active Test to judge whether the system is normal and narrow down the malfunctioning area. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000059X00GX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>[System selection screen: Body → Meter → Active Test] (combination meter)</title>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.56in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.96in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.56in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Reference Value</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>TelltaleNo.2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Blink (1 Hz)/turn off driver seat belt meter indicator</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Driver Seat Belt</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check the result of the Active Test and proceed to the following destination.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.01in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.12in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Blinks at 1 Hz or goes off</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Does not blink at 1 Hz or go off</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0017" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0019" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0017" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AFA00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Instrument Panel Junction Block Assembly (Main Body ECU)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Pre-inspection Preparation</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B167508J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Disconnect the connector shown in the illustration from the instrument panel junction block assembly (main body ECU).</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each vehicle side connector terminal and body ground in each buckle state of the front seat inner belt assembly RH.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>V-26 (DBKL) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tongue plate not inserted into buckle</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>V-26 (DBKL) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tongue plate inserted into buckle</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Check the inspection result and proceed to the destination below.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>NG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>OK</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0022" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0020" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0022" proc-id="RM0550J___0000AFB00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Front Seat Inner Belt Assembly RH</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B167509J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals in each buckle state.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt/>
</specitem>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="left">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1(+) - 2(E)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tongue plate not inserted into buckle</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1(+) - 2(E)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tongue plate inserted into buckle</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0025" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0027" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0027">
<testtitle>Replace Front Seat Inner Belt Assembly RH<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001ESH005X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0019">
<testtitle>Go to Meter &amp; Gauge System<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001L5T00JX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0020">
<testtitle>Replace Instrument Panel Junction Block Assembly (Main Body ECU)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000001OPX00AX_16_0025">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
